Test fixtures of @factoidal/core (not in the npm tarball)
========================================================

sample-store/
-------------

The sample Shardborough store holds five IPTC NewsCodes
vocabularies, converted from the publisher's RDF/XML and packed into
IBK3 predicate blocks:

  spamfstat, videoqualifier, subjectqualifier, videocodec, spct

  Publisher: International Press Telecommunications Council
             https://iptc.org/
  Licence:   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Obtained through: https://github.com/danbri/skosdex third_party/skos

The IRIs, labels and structure are the IPTC's. The block layout, the
dictionary, the indexes and the manifest are this package's encoding of
them. Redistribution of the vocabulary content stays under CC BY 4.0.


jena-arq-expr/
--------------

cases.json is derived from the one-line expression tests of Apache Jena,
jena-arq/src/test/java/org/apache/jena/sparql/expr/*.java, at commit
a1164c5dc5c9e1a9c58d94766c13d870e0a8ba98.

  Licence: Apache License, Version 2.0
           https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Change notice (Factoidal, 2026-10-26): each Java test call is rewritten
  as a SPARQL expression and a check kind by
  tools/jena-facade-study/extract.py; the Java source text of each test is
  kept in the "java" member. verdicts.json is Factoidal's own work.

